<title>FRANCE: MATIF working group reserved about developing Ecu.</title>
<headline>MATIF working group reserved about developing Ecu.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French futures exchange MATIF said members of its working group were reserved about the future of the Ecu ahead of the introduction of a single currency in 1999 and were not planning to expand its range of Ecu products.</p>
<p>However, MATIF said in a statement on Friday given that the situtation could always change rapidly it was prepared to increase the range of Ecu products if conditions appeared favourable.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
